abstract: >-
  Code, Solidity contracts, reproduction scripts and official result CSVs for the
  ICT Express manuscript "Constant on-chain commitment for federated learning
  rounds via hierarchical content identifiers". The experiments run on a local
  Anvil chain only (chain id 31337) and an offline Kubo node. They do not use
  a public network or real funds. The MedMNIST+ v3.0 images are not redistributed;
  they are available from Zenodo (10.5281/zenodo.10519652, CC BY 4.0).
